---
import CTAButton from '../ui/CTAButton.astro';

const affiliateLink = '#';
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/[0.08] via-white/[0.02] to-secondary-400/[0.06] px-6 py-14 sm:px-12 text-center backdrop-blur-sm">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-20 left-1/2 h-64 w-64 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 blur-[80px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-secondary-400/10 blur-[60px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Время сравнить условия</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">
          По совокупности параметров Mostbet набирает 4.3/5 для российских пользователей. Проверьте актуальные условия на платформе.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <CTAButton href={affiliateLink} size="lg" variant="cta" external>Посмотреть рейтинг</CTAButton>
          <CTAButton href="/about" variant="outline" size="lg">О нашей команде</CTAButton>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
